{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e968c970421f271612f665598efcd3db9cd03d317f0ca9667ae621e731e3375", "ja": "（ふう、もうこんな時間か。そろそろ休憩を……ん？）", "zh": "（呼，都已经这个时间了吗。差不多该休息一下了……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "a4178fb5e64ffcde2c8d8bfb1a9679e6cd72cf4e40072037bb91f83663ca502d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です。天海春香\nが飴をお届けですよ～♪　ひとついかがですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。天海春香来给您送糖果啦～♪ 要不要来一颗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1deb37dce9abae0cbea0c86509368c603a5c3a4dc7c1689b3468ea19da4425bb", "ja": "おお、春香。お疲れ様。\n飴？　って、ずいぶんたくさんあるな。", "zh": "哦，春香，辛苦了。  \n糖？等等，这也太多了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "a728fd02275450d306e08c83168862a65f918820dc0fac1b6d4f080dc9cbb6ef", "ja": "えへへ……さっき、駄菓子屋さんに寄ったんです。\nどれも美味しそうだなって。", "zh": "嘿嘿……刚才顺路去了一趟零食店。\n感觉每一种看起来都很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1004_p", "source_sha256": "df63c7974afb6c79f5108d87de0fb18b4737bf23aa5a942711c5e43fe5205e9f", "ja": "はは。色んな味があって、悩んじゃうよな。\nそれで結局、選びきれなかったりして……。", "zh": "哈哈。口味这么多，确实会让人纠结呢。结果到最后，说不定还会选不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "00250949e4d6e877aadb05e1f950785dff686c4b6eba4d8389ef36debbf76bb1", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}さんもですか？\nふふ、おんなじですね。", "zh": "诶，{$P$}先生也是吗？\n呵呵，我们一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b5d1cdd7048079558f8790cc74c60110eed667cfc91e9b5747e1af2bb16beadf", "ja": "……だな。それで、それだけ買っちゃったわけか。", "zh": "……是啊。所以，你就买了这么多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "fc4b380eba4cff106b8de621cd8595b4732cd2400bdebf04e266bd72f164b9cd", "ja": "はい♪　それに、たくさんあればみんなで食べられる\nかなーって。だから今日の私は飴のお届け屋さんです♪", "zh": "对呀♪ 而且我想着，买多一点的话，大家就都能一起吃了嘛——所以今天的我就是糖果配送员♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c7fcc9cda0e4e08d8edefecb8fd6ae7bb288da9273e17e316c2a9b63f6d7662d", "ja": "なるほど。それじゃあお届け屋さん、飴をひとつもらお\nうかな。ちょうど休憩しようと思ってたところなんだ。", "zh": "原来如此。那就给我一颗糖吧，送糖小使者。我正好打算休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0482_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0482_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "38f6a963da4789b1c650bcc9f5855da1ca19b9c85a0e0a0d49f48c3c0907dcdf", "ja": "はい、どうぞ。たくさん種類があるので\n好きな味を選んでくださいね♪", "zh": "好的，给你。糖果有很多种口味，请选你喜欢的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
